{
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "contracts_version": "1.2.0",
  "execution_endpoint": "/api/tools/execute",
  "request_schema_ref": "api.schema.json#/$defs/ExecuteRequest",
  "success_response_schema_ref": "api.schema.json#/$defs/ExecuteSuccessResponse",
  "conventions": [
    "All identifiers in examples are UUID v4 except invoice IDs (INV-0001..INV-0500), which are business keys.",
    "HTTP 200 always means status SUCCESS. Blocked or failed calls return an error.schema.json envelope.",
    "mutations_recorded is the number of invoice rows the call changed in the speculative database; stage_webhook always records 0.",
    "tool_decision is tool-level; session_gate_decision is the current session-level gate_decision. ALLOW never means approved for commit.",
    "Tools with read_only=false are rejected with 403 POLICY_BLOCK (details.reason SESSION_BLOCKED) once the session gate is BLOCK.",
    "Tool arguments are stored redacted (policies.json redaction). Invoice row values are never redacted.",
    "Agents receive no filesystem paths, connection strings or SQL access; tools operate only on the session's speculative database."
  ],
